  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ncot 15° × cot 75° × cot 60° × cot 30° + tan 45°\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n1. cot 15° = 2 + √3\n\n2. cot 75° = 2 - √3\n\n3. cot 60° = 1/√3\n\n4. cot 30° = √3\n\n5. tan 45° = 1\n\n**Calculations:**\n\ncot 15° × cot 75° × cot 60° × cot 30° + tan 45°\n\n⇒ (2 + √3) × (2 - √3) × (1/√3) × √3 + 1\n\n⇒ [(2 + √3)(2 - √3)] × (1/√3 × √3) + 1\n\n⇒ (4 - 3) × 1 + 1\n\n⇒ 1 + 1\n\n⇒ 2\n\n**∴ The value is 2.**",
